1
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,220
Mr. He, you called me here.

2
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:23,950
Anything I can do for you?

3
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:27,280
Dr. Jiang, could you examine

4
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,320
my injuries?

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,480
I took some hits to my back and shoulder.

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,659
They're still weak.

7
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,470
Just some internal bruising.

8
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:40,470
Nothing serious.

9
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,080
A few days of rest will do.

10
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:43,470
Though...

11
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:45,270
Mr. Wen

12
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,350
sure hits hard.

13
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,870
Sorry you had to see that.

14
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,450
I'm used to it.

15
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:55,240
After all, I'm not really family.

16
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,130
He has no reason to hold back.

17
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:01,660
You've worked for the Wen family
all these years.

18
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:04,769
And you still think
you're not real family?

19
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:07,510
You saw it today.

20
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,890
The Wen family's table

21
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:15,020
is not a place anyone can sit comfortably.

22
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,430
Their glory is only on the surface.

23
00:01:17,430 --> 00:01:18,430
While inside...

24
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:26,789
Will you agree

25
00:01:28,010 --> 00:01:29,539
that blood is the only thing

26
00:01:29,539 --> 00:01:30,940
that makes a family real?

27
00:01:33,289 --> 00:01:34,890
You're beating around the bush.

28
00:01:34,890 --> 00:01:36,750
What are you really trying to say?

29
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,880
What I'm saying is...

30
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:41,920
maybe you and I

31
00:01:42,229 --> 00:01:43,690
share more than you think.

32
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:59,650
Your family is full of monsters.

33
00:02:00,750 --> 00:02:02,550
You're just like your daughter.

34
00:02:02,580 --> 00:02:03,810
You enjoy treating people
like chess pieces,

35
00:02:03,810 --> 00:02:05,170
moving them around

36
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,370
however you please.

37
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,690
This report is fake.

38
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:12,700
You thought I wouldn't know?

39
00:02:13,890 --> 00:02:14,960
You're a doctor.

40
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:17,180
I'm sure you know

41
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,040
how to verify if it's fake.

42
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:21,030
I had nothing back then.

43
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,800
But, Yuqing,

44
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,560
your mother,

45
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:26,470
still loved me

46
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,430
I thought we would

47
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,240
spend our lives together.

48
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,470
Then Wen Xin chose me.

49
00:02:33,329 --> 00:02:35,329
Wen Yanhui forced me with his power.

50
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,880
He even threatened me
with my mother's illness.

51
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:38,880
I had no choice.

52
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:41,890
If I had known you existed,

53
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,530
I never would have left you two.

54
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:48,820
Jiang Yu,

55
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:51,550
come back to me, okay?

56
00:02:52,170 --> 00:02:53,640
I have everything now.

57
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,910
Let me make up for everything I owe you.

58
00:02:58,100 --> 00:02:59,710
[Dearest Episode 4]

59
00:03:03,140 --> 00:03:04,420
What can you do for me?

60
00:03:05,890 --> 00:03:07,320
I can ruin Wen Jianan

61
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:09,790
and take over Wen Group.

62
00:03:09,910 --> 00:03:11,910
The Wen family will become history.

63
00:03:12,530 --> 00:03:14,180
You're my only son.

64
00:03:14,370 --> 00:03:16,490
Everything I have will belong to you.

65
00:03:17,070 --> 00:03:18,440
Will you join me

66
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:20,120
and bring them down together?

67
00:03:30,050 --> 00:03:30,840
Of course.

68
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:34,560
Wen Jianan.

69
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:37,700
How could you be my sister?

70
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,040
The medical bills...

71
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:54,220
My dad is sick.

72
00:03:54,570 --> 00:03:55,970
I need money for school.

73
00:03:56,290 --> 00:03:57,329
You are smart.

74
00:03:57,750 --> 00:04:00,150
You knew that making money
from the wealthy

75
00:04:00,330 --> 00:04:02,590
was smarter than struggling on your own.

76
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:11,100
Consider this the price I paid
for being soft-hearted.

77
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:11,960
Remember this.

78
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,520
Leave a family like this
as soon as you can.

79
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:17,810
Use your way of thinking
to make money from the rich.

80
00:04:21,010 --> 00:04:23,410
Rich people's money
is the easiest to make.

81
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,200
Since fate chose this way

82
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,890
to tie us together,

83
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,840
then let's walk into hell together.

84
00:05:36,659 --> 00:05:38,420
No one gets out.

85
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,480
I'm still part of the Wen family.

86
00:05:42,350 --> 00:05:44,150
There are some things I can't do.

87
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:46,310
But

88
00:05:47,159 --> 00:05:48,159
you have the right to know

89
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:49,750
how your mother died.

90
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,040
Honey,

91
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:19,870
you should sleep in our room tonight.

92
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:22,510
♪ Deep red wine in the darkness ♪

93
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,330
I have documents to review.

94
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,120
I'll sleep in the study.

95
00:06:24,230 --> 00:06:25,440
I won't disturb you.

96
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:29,940
♪ Only a breath, only a spark ♪

97
00:06:31,330 --> 00:06:42,190
♪ Let the shadows play their parts
and intertwine ♪

98
00:06:40,450 --> 00:06:41,510
Does it still hurt?

99
00:06:42,780 --> 00:06:43,580
I'm used to it.

100
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:47,850
♪ Slowly, slow it down ♪

101
00:06:49,250 --> 00:06:53,600
♪ Nowhere to run, nowhere to go ♪

102
00:06:51,770 --> 00:06:52,580
Honey.

103
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,159
Why did you take the hit for me?

104
00:06:55,860 --> 00:07:00,240
♪ Let it flow quietly with the rhythm ♪

105
00:06:58,860 --> 00:07:00,590
You still care about me,

106
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:06,270
♪ Stay, just for tonight,
come a little closer ♪

107
00:07:01,510 --> 00:07:02,310
don't you?

108
00:07:21,830 --> 00:07:24,270
Wen Xin, you make me sick.

109
00:07:24,990 --> 00:07:26,210
I took those hits for you

110
00:07:26,210 --> 00:07:27,880
because I'm the family's son-in-law.

111
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,340
It was my responsibility.

112
00:07:29,890 --> 00:07:30,920
Nothing more.

113
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:00,720
Mom, Jie.

114
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,880
I'll get you the justice you deserve.

115
00:08:08,490 --> 00:08:10,560
Sir, Mr. Qin from Wansheng is here.

116
00:08:14,990 --> 00:08:16,190
I sent you a video.

117
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:17,330
Have someone analyze it.

118
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:18,570
Go through it frame by frame.

119
00:08:18,570 --> 00:08:20,180
Find out whether it was edited.

120
00:08:20,180 --> 00:08:20,980
Also,

121
00:08:21,510 --> 00:08:22,300
investigate

122
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:24,610
He Mu's whereabouts the night Jie died.

123
00:08:25,010 --> 00:08:27,590
He abandoned my mother and me
for so many years,

124
00:08:27,590 --> 00:08:29,890
and now he's pretending
to be some loving father?

125
00:08:29,890 --> 00:08:31,200
I must know

126
00:08:31,970 --> 00:08:33,570
what exactly he is planning.

127
00:08:36,980 --> 00:08:40,760
[Heir to Wansheng Group, Qin Yue]

128
00:08:44,470 --> 00:08:45,360
Alex,

129
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:48,160
you've never been the one
to call me first.

130
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,610
What, missed me?

131
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:52,130
Minister Zhou,

132
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:54,520
I heard there's a plot of land
in the Xingji Development Zone

133
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:55,520
open for bidding.

134
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:58,210
You wanna expand into a new sector?

135
00:08:58,230 --> 00:08:59,030
Not me.

136
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:02,090
It's Councilman Qin's son, Qin Yue.

137
00:09:02,690 --> 00:09:03,690
He wants in.

138
00:09:04,570 --> 00:09:05,690
Mr. Qin Jr.?

139
00:09:06,580 --> 00:09:08,780
Why would you suddenly want to help him?

140
00:09:09,070 --> 00:09:10,730
Think of it as a favor I owe you.

141
00:09:11,330 --> 00:09:12,140
And

142
00:09:13,060 --> 00:09:14,860
a small gift to welcome Mr. Qin.

143
00:09:15,370 --> 00:09:17,170
Since you rarely ask me for help,

144
00:09:17,370 --> 00:09:18,090
you got it.

145
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:19,920
I'll take care of it tomorrow.

146
00:09:22,850 --> 00:09:24,350
I've heard Alex of Cloudsea

147
00:09:24,350 --> 00:09:26,080
has extraordinary influence.

148
00:09:26,220 --> 00:09:27,150
Today,

149
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:29,360
I finally understand why.

150
00:09:29,490 --> 00:09:30,570
My father and I

151
00:09:30,930 --> 00:09:32,200
spent six months
trying to secure that land,

152
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,650
yet couldn't even get an introduction.

153
00:09:33,650 --> 00:09:34,500
But you

154
00:09:34,970 --> 00:09:36,630
solved it with one phone call.

155
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:37,960
From now on,

156
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:40,520
whenever you need me,

157
00:09:40,930 --> 00:09:42,020
just give the word.

158
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:46,110
I do have something I need your help with.

159
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:51,030
Wansheng is casting
for a new film, isn't it?

160
00:09:55,940 --> 00:09:58,250
Yes, it's Director Chen's film.

161
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:01,060
You want Miss Wen

162
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,840
as the lead?

163
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:06,560
Her reputation
has taken some hits recently.

164
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:08,850
Many investors may object.

165
00:10:10,490 --> 00:10:12,300
But casting the female lead

166
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:14,450
is still within my authority.

167
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:20,370
You don't have to cast her.

168
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,530
I only want you

169
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,200
to let her see a way back.

170
00:10:30,410 --> 00:10:32,340
Let her believe she can rise again.

171
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,600
And then...

172
00:10:35,250 --> 00:10:36,680
crush her completely.

173
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,530
I see.

174
00:10:41,770 --> 00:10:45,100
So things between you and Miss Wen
aren't exactly pleasant.

175
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:47,890
I want her fall

176
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:51,320
to hurt as much as possible.

177
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,160
Shang Yu.

178
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,960
Is the person on this poster

179
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,210
the hottest star right now?

180
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,380
It doesn't matter.

181
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:29,930
Because before long,

182
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:32,060
you'll be the hottest star again.

183
00:11:32,410 --> 00:11:34,930
I know everything you've been through.

184
00:11:35,370 --> 00:11:37,840
Mr. Qin Jr. is Councilman Qin's son.

185
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:39,170
When he comes,

186
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,930
make sure you seize this chance

187
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,760
to win back everything you lost.

188
00:11:43,170 --> 00:11:44,100
I believe in you.

189
00:11:54,650 --> 00:11:55,530
Mr. Qin is here.

190
00:12:00,050 --> 00:12:00,840
Mr. Qin.

191
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,600
This is Miss Wen.

192
00:12:04,010 --> 00:12:05,740
A pleasure to finally meet you.

193
00:12:06,250 --> 00:12:09,050
Miss Wen, you're even
more dazzling in person.

194
00:12:10,410 --> 00:12:11,740
You flatter me, Mr. Qin.

195
00:12:11,890 --> 00:12:15,090
I've long admired Wansheng Capital
and your reputation.

196
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:18,640
It's an honor to finally meet you today.

197
00:12:31,370 --> 00:12:32,170
Mr. Qin.

198
00:12:32,530 --> 00:12:34,320
Jianan was injured some time ago

199
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,720
and has been recovering.

200
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,710
But she's always been passionate
about her career.

201
00:12:37,710 --> 00:12:39,090
She's been wanting to make a comeback.

202
00:12:39,090 --> 00:12:41,460
I heard Wansheng recently invested in

203
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:43,200
an S+ level blockbuster film.

204
00:12:43,410 --> 00:12:44,800
It's currently casting worldwide.

205
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:45,480
Yes.

206
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:49,040
It's Director Chen's annual project.

207
00:12:49,250 --> 00:12:51,770
The female lead is a complicated woman

208
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:54,560
who suffers a major tragedy
and keeps searching for the truth.

209
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:56,200
It's a very challenging role.

210
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,650
I think Miss Wen's aura

211
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:59,290
has a subtle connection

212
00:12:59,770 --> 00:13:00,900
with the character.

213
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:06,170
I've heard Miss Wen is talented
in both singing and dancing.

214
00:13:06,530 --> 00:13:08,330
I wonder if we'll have the chance

215
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,680
to see Miss Wen perform today.

216
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:12,770
Sorry, Mr. Qin.

217
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:15,220
Jianan's legs have only just recovered.

218
00:13:18,210 --> 00:13:20,310
But look how many friends I brought today.

219
00:13:20,310 --> 00:13:21,490
It would be a shame

220
00:13:22,730 --> 00:13:24,190
if you didn't dance for us.

221
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:27,480
If we could have the honor
of seeing Miss Wen dance,

222
00:13:27,850 --> 00:13:30,180
then this trip would truly be worthwhile.

223
00:13:30,770 --> 00:13:31,860
Right, everyone?

224
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:33,290
Yes.

225
00:13:33,290 --> 00:13:34,080
Right.

226
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,080
Of course.

227
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:37,050
Mr. Qin Jr., do you want something
to happen between us?

228
00:14:37,050 --> 00:14:37,890
Mr. Qin Jr.,

229
00:14:37,890 --> 00:14:40,320
if that's really what you want,

230
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:44,580
then things between us would be
much more complicated.
